Package: ForecastEnsembles
Title: Probabilistic Forecast Ensembling via ForecastEnsembles.jl
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Sebastian", "Funk",
           email = "sebastian.funk@lshtm.ac.uk",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2842-3406"))
Description: A thin R interface to the Julia package ForecastEnsembles.jl, which
    unifies the methods previously spread across hubEnsembles, qrensemble
    and lopensemble under one in-memory representation and one set of
    verbs (combine() and fit()). All numerical work is done in Julia via
    juliaready (which uses JuliaConnectoR under the hood); data frames
    are round-tripped at the API boundary.
